This repository is an intentionally vulnerable, controlled training environment
created to teach OWASP ZAP scripting, security testing, scan automation,
reporting, and evidence-based security decisions.

- The Globomantics application, security configurations, credentials, scripts,
  and CI examples exist for demonstration and learning only.
- This project is not production-ready and must not be deployed, exposed, or
  reused as a production application or security-testing platform.
- The examples are intentionally simplified to make specific security concepts
  observable and reproducible; they have not been validated against production
  datasets, enterprise traffic, or real-world deployment requirements.
- Security weaknesses are included deliberately. An insecure implementation here
  is part of the exercise, not an endorsement of that implementation.
- Use this project only in an isolated, authorized lab. Never point its active
  scanning scripts at systems you do not have explicit permission to test.

Permission is granted to use, copy, and modify this material for personal,
educational, and training purposes, provided this notice is retained.

THE MATERIAL IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
IMPLIED. THE AUTHOR IS NOT LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM OR DAMAGES ARISING FROM ITS USE.
Use only in an isolated, authorized lab.

